{"id":5312,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":504,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"08:48  广场中央谈判大厅","style":9,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"会场内只剩下阵阵哀嚎，卓娅丢开手中晕倒的黑帮，听到地面传来远处的声声震动。","style":3,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"……厄尔希还是动手了吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5212003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"都说了这是我一个人的事，那帮家伙……这不是拖我后腿吗。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5212004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"加快速度吧，不然他们撑不到我回去了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5212005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"说着，她大步跨过地上东倒西歪的精英治安官，一把提起被震倒在地的彭斯。","style":3,"background":501,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"现在，跟我聊聊你背后的“朋友”，彭斯先生。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5212007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":501,"log_type":1}]}